---
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';

const meta = {
  title: "开源与致谢 · Hufu",
  description: "Hufu 原创代码采用 MIT 许可。第三方组件保留各自许可，虎码词表按官方发布条款随包提供。",
};
---

<Base locale="zh" slug="open-source" title={meta.title} description={meta.description}>
  <main id="main"><div class="page-content wrap"><div class="page-heading"><a class="back-link" href="/">Hufu 首页 <span aria-hidden="true">/</span></a><h1>代码和依赖，都有出处。</h1><p>Hufu 原创代码采用 MIT 许可。第三方组件保留各自许可，虎码词表按官方发布条款随包提供。</p></div><section class="open-intro prose"><h2>Hufu 的代码和依赖。</h2><p>Hufu 是基于 librime 的独立 macOS 前端，不是鼠须管的分支。原创代码采用 MIT；librime、OpenCC 等第三方组件与虎码方案各自保留原许可。</p><div class="source-actions"><a class="button primary" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu">GitHub · syhily/hufu <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a class="button secondary" href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/tree/main/dicts/huma">词库目录 · dicts/huma <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a></div><div class="code-block"><pre><code>git clone https://github.com/syhily/hufu.git</code></pre><button data-copy-code>复制</button></div><p>Hufu 不捆绑任何原生插件：librime 及其依赖以静态库形式内嵌，安装包不含 GPL 组件；虎码词表按官方发布条款随包提供，对应源码与词表随 GitHub Release 提供。</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/blob/main/docs/license-packaging-verification.md">第三方声明 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/releases">Releases 与对应源码 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/blob/main/LICENSE">MIT 许可全文 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a></div></section><div class="license-table"><div><strong>Hufu 原创代码</strong><span>MIT</span><p>© 2026 syhily</p></div><div><strong>虎码词表</strong><span>官方发布条款</span><p>来自虎码官方秃版 2026.08.15，按原发布条款使用</p></div><div><strong>随包第三方内容</strong><span>按组件保留原许可</span><p>librime（BSD-3-Clause）与 OpenCC（Apache-2.0）</p><p>leveldb / marisa-trie / yaml-cpp / Boost 保留各自许可</p></div></div><p class="prose">本站使用系统字体渲染，不加载第三方字体。</p><section class="prose"><h2>Hufu 用到了这些开源项目。</h2><p>这些项目为引擎、词表、繁简转换与配置解析提供了基础。商标与名称属于各自权利人，以下致谢不代表合作或背书。</p><ul class="upstream-list"><li><a href="https://github.com/rime/librime">RIME / librime <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSD-3-Clause</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/BYVoid/OpenCC">OpenCC <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>Apache-2.0</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/google/leveldb">leveldb <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSD-3-Clause</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/s-yata/marisa-trie">marisa-trie <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSD-2-Clause / LGPL-2.1</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/jbeder/yaml-cpp">yaml-cpp <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>MIT</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/boostorg/boost">Boost <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>BSL-1.0</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/jpsim/Yams">Yams <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>MIT</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/apple/swift-argument-parser">swift-argument-parser <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>Apache-2.0</span></li><li><a href="https://github.com/syhily/hufu/tree/main/dicts/huma">虎码官方秃版 <svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12"></path></svg></a><span>官方发布条款</span></li></ul><p>Hufu 由 syhily 开发与维护，界面与文档结构参考了 AIME（艾么输入法，作者自己的旧项目）。感谢虎码作者、RIME 与开源社区。</p></section></div></main>
</Base>
